Approved plan: `.gjc/_session-01a031f9-aa43-703c-b219-d0e2d7a27a4d/plans/ralplan/01a031f9-aa43-703c-b219-d0e2d7a27a4d/pending-approval.md`. Preserve all locked intent, explicit economics, hard-removal, candidate-catalog CAS, crash-safe publication, identity, stateless callback, public algebra, cross-repo parity, and no-commit/no-push constraints. qlibx is sibling `../qlibx`; consumer is `vqapr-testbed-2`.

@goal: Freeze baseline and public contract
Capture the current qlibx/testbed export inventory, canonical input/declaration/schedule/output manifests, normalized trace/row hash contracts, parity commands, performance protocol, and exact new public declaration algebra in tests/fixtures/docs before behavioral migration. Keep product working and run focused baseline tests.

@goal: Implement authoring contracts and internal authority boundary
Add exact capability namespaces and immutable declaration/model contracts, named inputs, typed observations, semantic Hold/Rebalance/StrategyResult, bounded account/history/constraint/diagnostic types, versioned identity bytes, fresh callback instances, and physically relocate retained authority beneath `vqapr._internal` while preserving current behavior through internal adapters. Run focused unit/boundary tests.

@goal: Implement Project transactions and atomic publication
Implement non-mutating `open`, closed ProjectDeclaration registration, candidate-catalog validation/preflight and generation-CAS commit, Project materialize/run, one callback root for decision/state/diagnostics/evidence, content-addressed allocation/record staging and one catalog visibility swap, orphan recovery, conflict/crash/failure tests, and CompletedRun atomic Publication. Run focused integration tests.

@goal: Dogfood and hard-remove the old qlibx API
Migrate shipped venues, constraints, CLI, scaffolds, skills, docs, README, every showcase and test to the capability namespaces and Project workflow. Delete `vqapr.public` and former qualified lifecycle/storage/Flow/evidence routes without redirects or aliases. Prove exact exports and forbidden import failure. Keep qlibx tests, ruff, build, isolated wheel and showcases green.

@goal: Migrate the factor testbed and prove scientific parity
Migrate the whole `vqapr-testbed-2` pipeline including register.py, models, materialization, simulation and atomic publication; retire or replace measure_session_effect public-path diagnostics. Use only supported namespaces, one root, one run and one publish per factor while retaining every explicit economic declaration. Run complete factor rebuild/comparison and exact normalized manifest/trace/row/parity/performance checks; update PRD/architecture/implementation/handoff records. Do not git add, commit, push or publish; stop for owner review after the full Ultragoal cohort and terminal critic gates.
